Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Sat Jun 13 04:58:07 2026 +0800

    behavioral: S/U resume mirrors the producer's PMP block (L6 F2, L2 partial)

    With PMP implemented and no matching entry, every S/U access faults, so
    an S/U ROI cannot fetch on the vsim side without the producer's PMP
    config. Mirror all 64 pmpaddr then the 8 even pmpcfg CSRs (tolerant
    writes; unimplemented entries no-op) before writing dcsr.prv. M-mode
    handoffs keep PMP pass-through-only.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

